// Topic 5: the ATM description language.
//
// Implement the grammar described in topic-5/README.md. The rule names
// Atm, Event, State, Transition and Action and their attribute names are
// fixed: the tests read the model through them.
// Action in particular must be one rule that assigns `kind` in each
// alternative (see "The model" in README.md).
//
// The skeleton below parses only the first line of a description.

Atm:
    'atm' name=ID
;
